{
 "encounter_id": "00530",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning. I made a list so I wouldn't forget anything. Short version, I can't read my newspaper anymore, and it's driving me up the wall."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning, Mr Kowalski. Let's get right into it. When did you first notice trouble with the newspaper?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I wrote it down. The twelfth of August I couldn't make out the crossword clues. So about three months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Three months. Is it all blurry, or is a part of the page missing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's blurry in the middle of my vision. The edges are fine. If I look right at a word, it disappears."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a very specific description, thank you. Any other changes in how things look?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, straight lines look wavy. The tiles in the bathroom, the door frame. Marisol noticed me running my hand along the wall."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He was checking if the wall was bent. I told him the wall is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Marisol, you live with him, correct? Are you his full-time caregiver?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Live-in, yes, for two years now. I do the driving too, which is how he got here."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good to have you. Mr Kowalski, anything else on your list?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Headlights at night are blinding. The glare is much worse than before. And I tripped on the curb twice, last Tuesday and Friday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Twice in one week is important. Did you hurt yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A skinned knee. Nothing else."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any flashing lights or floaters, anything like curtains coming across?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No flashing lights. No curtain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any pain in either eye, or redness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No eye pain. They just feel tired."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, a quick check on the rest of you. Any weakness, numbness, or trouble speaking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none of that. I'd have called 911."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exactly right. Let's go through your medicines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I have them here. Metformin, 500 mg twice a day. Lisinopril, 10 mg once a day. And atorvastatin, 20 mg at bedtime."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good list. And what are they for, so I can match them up with your history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, I've had that since 2004. High blood pressure. And high cholesterol."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any allergies to medication?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sulfa drugs. I got a rash as a kid and my mother had me avoid them ever since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A childhood rash from sulfa, avoided since, noted. Have you had any surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cataract surgery on the left eye in 2018. And a hernia repair about fifteen years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Anyone in the family with eye disease?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had macular degeneration. My brother has glaucoma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's relevant. Do you smoke or drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I quit smoking in 1990. One glass of wine with dinner. I live with Marisol, as she said."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Great. I'll do your vitals now, then examine your eyes.",
   "pause": 0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure is 142 over 80. Heart rate is 68. Oxygen saturation 98 percent. Temperature 36.7 degrees. Weight is 82 kilograms.",
   "pause": 20
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now cover your left eye and read the chart on the wall.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "E. F. P. Then it gets fuzzy. I can't get the line after that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Visual acuity is 20 over 60 in the right eye. I'm shining a light in your eyes now.",
   "pause": 16
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your pupils react normally, and there's no redness in either eye. Your pressure feels normal to touch.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is this serious? Be straight with me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll be straight. This looks like early macular degeneration, the same family of problem your mother had. With your diabetes I also want to rule out damage from the diabetes to the retina."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is there a cure?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Some forms can be treated and slowed, especially if we catch it early. That's why I'm moving quickly today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What are you going to do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll refer you to the ophthalmologist, and my team will book it this week. I also want an OCT scan, which takes a detailed picture of the back of the eye, and a visual field test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like an HbA1c blood test today, to check your diabetes control."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Until then, good lighting for reading, a magnifier is fine, and get Marisol to hold your arm on curbs. No driving at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I haven't driven at night for a year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. I'll see you again in four weeks, with the scan results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. I'll write it in the diary."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll remind him too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Perfect. That's all from me. Any other questions on your list?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All crossed off. Thank you, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take care, both of you."
  }
 ],
